WEBVTT

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:13.240
Someone beloved to me...

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:19.740
I first learned what that meant... during the winter when I was fifteen years old.

00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:59.640
Yano embraces me.

00:02:09.190 --> 00:02:12.980
The smoothness of my uniform against my skin feels good.

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:24.740
Yano's hands... touch my back.

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:38.220
Somehow, I can feel Yano's masculinity really coming through.

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:49.100
Yano's fingers run through my hair.

00:02:56.320 --> 00:02:59.400
Leaving myself so open to him makes my heart clench up.

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:04.660
Yano kisses me.

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:07.200
It leaves me so hopeless, unable to think...

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:13.460
And... Yano's hands on my chest...

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:18.300
Wait just a second!!

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:21.220
Let go.

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:21.840
No!

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:28.020
You won't let me?

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:30.430
Obviously not!

00:03:30.430 --> 00:03:32.440
I-Is it that obvious?

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:34.560
Y-Yes, for now...

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:46.120
If I just touch...

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:47.990
You wouldn't stop with just a touch.

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:11.640
I wonder if I was wrong this afternoon...

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:19.860
Though for a second, I thought it might actually be all right...

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:22.240
Being held tightly by Yano...

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:25.990
I'm afraid of what that version of me would be like...

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:29.620
...so I ended up stopping unconsciously.

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:32.000
I'm sorry, Yano.

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:34.580
Right now, I'm not really sure what's right.

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:42.210
I got here before him.

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:54.270
All of this jewelry's so cute!

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:00.520
If you'd like, I can take some out for you.

00:05:00.520 --> 00:05:02.110
Yes, please.

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:09.120
She's such a beautiful woman...

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:12.660
Ah... but I may not be buying anything today, so...

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:16.120
There's nothing wrong with just looking.

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:19.130
Would you like to try one on?

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:32.560
Takaha--

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:34.560
Ah, Yano.

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:39.520
Do you think this one's cute?

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:50.950
Huh? You're Takeuchi-kun's older sister?

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:54.450
A-Ah, Takeuchi-kun is always taking good care of me!

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:58.540
If you're a friend of Masahami, I can get you a discount as a friend.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:05:59.960
Really?

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:02.500
I'm going to buy one now! I'm definitely going to!

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:05.210
Yano, do you mind if I look around a little longer?

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:06.510
Go ahead.

00:06:13.510 --> 00:06:15.890
Why are you acting so surprised?

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:17.850
I wasn't really surprised or anything.

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:21.360
You've really grown since I last saw you.

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:27.110
Your girlfriend's cute. She seems like a good girl.

00:06:27.110 --> 00:06:28.820
Ah, well, I suppose.

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:30.820
She sorta looks like a baby, though.

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:31.990
Like a baby?

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:37.450
U-Umm... could I see this one please?

00:06:37.450 --> 00:06:39.120
Ah, gladly.

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:44.130
It's hard to decide...

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:48.380
Yano, do you think this looks good on me?

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:55.760
She is a baby...

00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:58.020
Ah, no, maybe something more childi--

00:06:58.020 --> 00:06:58.980
What?

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:00.690
Maybe something cuter.

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:02.440
This is cute.

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:04.730
Oh, I know! Just wait here a sec.

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:11.740
We just got these in today, and we haven't even put them on display yet.

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:16.950
It's so adorable...

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:19.960
There are flower-shaped gems inset into it...

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:21.750
That's a nice one.

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:23.460
Yeah. That definitely would fit someone like you.

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:25.090
Ah, then I'll take...

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:28.710
I-It's so expensive...

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:33.140
Ah, umm... I think I'll go with the one I was just trying on instead...

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:34.220
It was less expensive...

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:36.100
So I'll go with the other one, please.

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:42.560
Ah, the other one? We only have those sizes 11 and 13.

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:44.520
That's too big for you, right?

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:48.400
H-Huh? The one I just had on fit me perfectly...

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:49.440
Was I just imagining it?

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:50.610
I'm terribly sorry.

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:53.360
Ah, then I'll take another look around...

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:56.580
That would be fine. We have many other cute rings.

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:06.250
You're buying it, right?

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:07.920
Of course.

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:14.090
Umm... could I pay in installments?

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:15.930
The money I'll get for New Year and my allowance...

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:17.970
And then if I sell those things...

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:20.430
Or maybe a deferred payment?

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:22.480
Having the product delivered later, of course.

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:23.480
Moron.

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:27.110
Then hold it until I have enough money.

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:27.980
Don't sell it.

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:31.240
If I did that, you'd never make it in time for Christmas.

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:34.240
Y-Yeah... you have a point.

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:36.240
I'll just use my E.D. and get it for you.

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:37.660
Your E.D.?

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:39.580
Employee discount.

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:40.660
It'll only cost 60% of its value.

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:42.410
In other words, 40% off.

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:45.580
If it's 40% off, then...

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:49.670
Things like this... are really against the rules, though.

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:50.880
But I'll make this one time a special case.

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:58.510
But you'd damn well better not forget, so bring me all of the money you have on hand by next week.

00:08:58.510 --> 00:09:01.810
I hate lending money to people in the first place.

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:04.890
Let's go.

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:07.310
I'm hungry.

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:08.810
Let's get something to eat.

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:16.030
Ayaka-san was really mature and beautiful, wasn't she?

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:16.910
I guess so...

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:21.910
I wonder if I can end up like her if I try really hard...

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:25.910
Y-Yeah... I'm sure you can.

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:30.090
Ah, I figured it out!

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:31.670
What?

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:34.970
Why Takeuchi-kun has such a hard time getting a girlfriend.

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:36.970
He seems like he'd be pretty popular.

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:37.760
What?

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:40.890
His older sister's too beautiful, so he has higher standards for his dream girl than normal.

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:43.220
I get it now... yeah, yeah.

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:47.900
Takeuchi-kun probably wants a girl more beautiful and mature than his older sister.

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:49.940
I don't really think that's it.

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:51.900
Anyway...

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:56.150
You said Takeuchi-kun is always taking good care of you.

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:58.410
Just when has he "taken good care of you"?

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:07.620
Ah... that was just a figure of speech... umm...

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:09.670
It was just meant as a greeting.

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:12.290
Ah... I can't believe this is happening...

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:14.170
Yano's jealous.

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:16.670
It all seems so unreal...

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:18.930
So unreal...

00:10:19.890 --> 00:10:22.300
I'm sorry for being a bit of a tease about this, Yano...

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:25.020
...but you're just so cute.

00:10:25.020 --> 00:10:28.810
I hope Takeuchi-kun finds a girl soon.

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:30.900
After all, Takeuchi-kun's a good guy.

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:31.980
I'll cheer him on.

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:34.900
And then maybe once he gets one, the four of us could go on a double date.

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:37.400
Why do the four of us have to go somewhere together?

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:43.950
It's fine if the two of us are alone together, right?

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:54.710
Yeah...

00:10:58.170 --> 00:11:00.970
I want to firmly accept Yano's feelings.

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:13.150
What? You two met?

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:16.320
Yeah. She treated me really well.

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:19.030
I hate to say this, but... she's really a he, dressed up in female clothing.

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:23.530
But... she was really beautiful and so feminine, it surprised me.

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:25.410
Ah, just stop.

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:27.540
He's got you totally fooled.

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:31.960
In the first place, calling that guy a male is really an insult to all men.

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:34.540
Men are more delicate.

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:37.250
When I was a kid, I had no idea...

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:40.380
...so I was always the messenger between him and the other guys he was with.

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:41.800
It was awful.

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:47.060
I totally thought you had a sister complex or something.

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:49.310
P-Please stop... I'm begging you...

00:11:49.310 --> 00:11:52.520
Then why don't you have a girlfriend?

00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:55.520
That's straight to the point.

00:11:58.320 --> 00:12:01.950
Really, these people who are all lovey-dovey nowadays...

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:03.320
Anyway, it's because he's gay.

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:04.240
Go to hell.

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:06.700
I... I wouldn't say we're that lovey-dovey...

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:09.410
And besides, it's not like you're not popular.

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:10.660
I'm not.

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:12.210
It's because I'm not popular that I'm single.

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:13.830
What? You're kidding!

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:15.210
Like I've been saying, he's a homo.

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:17.960
Isn't there anyone you like?

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:23.260
No.

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:24.300
Why not?

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:30.810
Who knows? Maybe it's a sister complex after all.

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:35.270
That was weird...

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:47.050
You haven't even put a single stick of incense... Pretty heartless, aren't we?

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:52.390
Even though half a year's passed since then.

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:56.480
Well, I know Onee-chan always had a bad eye for guys.

00:13:58.060 --> 00:14:00.810
Is that... her scarf?

00:14:03.030 --> 00:14:04.820
It was originally mine.

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:09.950
She would always borrow stuff from everyone.

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:12.280
And she'd always get it dirty right away.

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:17.210
She returned one of my favorite T-shirts with a large tomato juice stain on it.

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:21.340
How could she make such a big stain, just like a child?

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:28.510
Do you want it as a memento?

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:33.220
Don't act like you're so cool.

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:37.230
She threw you out.

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:46.820
Don't act like you're so much better than me.

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:50.780
You sisters, both older and younger, are the worst.

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:03.340
Don't...

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:07.970
...group me with her.

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:13.450
Hurry and end already...

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:23.870
I've been thinking about Yano all day.

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:28.880
Ah, it's almost time to catch the bus.

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:30.340
Are you gonna go?

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:31.840
Yeah.

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:34.390
S-Should I just wait for the next one?

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:38.100
You said that the last time, too. "Just one more hour."

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:45.440
I... I guess there's no end to it.

00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:47.820
I'll go home. I'm sure Mom will be worrying, too.

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:51.110
Want to kiss one more time before you go?

00:16:53.530 --> 00:16:55.110
People are watching...

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:57.160
No, they're not.

00:16:57.160 --> 00:16:58.620
Look, they're all minding their own business.

00:17:09.040 --> 00:17:10.800
Should we go, then?

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:12.090
Yes.

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:15.380
It's getting harder and harder to part from him...

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:18.720
Here it is.

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:24.100
Ah, bye...

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:32.150
I'll take you home.

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:06.770
I wished that bus would never stop.

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:15.150
I wonder if there's a limit to how much one person can love another...

00:18:18.240 --> 00:18:19.200
I don't get this at all.

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:24.160
Yamamoto-san, could you teach me how to do this part?

00:18:24.870 --> 00:18:28.670
Takahashi-san, you have the left and right side reversed.

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:33.210
You loosen it here, and from this part over here, if you just...

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:36.720
...and she already hates him so much, but...

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:39.220
...it looks like it's all right.

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:41.100
There you go.

00:18:41.100 --> 00:18:42.180
Thanks a lot.

00:18:42.810 --> 00:18:45.180
I'm really bad at sewing clothing...

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:48.060
I hate doing this, too.

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:52.860
Yamamoto-san's a little scary with all the stuff she hates...

00:18:57.280 --> 00:18:58.700
What did you do in gym today?

00:18:58.700 --> 00:18:59.950
Basketball.

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:01.200
That sounds like fun.

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:02.780
Are you going to the food stand?

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:03.530
Yeah.

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:06.700
Could you get me some milk while you're there?

00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:08.120
It was really awesome!

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:08.710
Really!

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:10.210
Yeah, it ruled!

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:34.610
Don't group me with her.

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:10.890
Yano!

00:20:11.890 --> 00:20:13.520
Are you all right?

00:20:13.520 --> 00:20:15.400
Ah.. yeah.

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:16.110
Yamamoto-san?

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:25.120
Hey... not a word of thanks to Yano?

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:27.160
Yano, you scraped your hand.

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:29.200
Ah, yeah.

00:20:34.170 --> 00:20:35.420
Thank you.

00:20:38.210 --> 00:20:39.170
Yano.

00:20:43.180 --> 00:20:46.680
I don't think you have to watch out for Yamamoto-san so much.

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:53.850
The problem between you and Nana-san is just between you two...

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:57.020
...and her death isn't your fault in the least.

00:20:59.150 --> 00:21:00.110
I know.

00:21:01.240 --> 00:21:04.110
I'm sorry. I don't know how to say it--

00:21:04.110 --> 00:21:05.660
Yano?

00:21:05.660 --> 00:21:07.740
Don't worry about it.

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:10.240
Ah, we're on a bed.

00:21:10.240 --> 00:21:12.500
Moron. Why are you so quick to say that sort of stuff?

00:21:21.670 --> 00:21:22.760
Kiss me.

00:21:24.470 --> 00:21:26.430
And make it a long one.

00:21:26.430 --> 00:21:28.010
Someone could come in.

00:21:28.010 --> 00:21:28.600
They won't.

00:21:28.600 --> 00:21:29.260
They will.

00:21:29.260 --> 00:21:30.680
It's lunch break.

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:32.680
Who cares if we're seen?

00:21:41.150 --> 00:21:42.190
Oh, whatever.

00:21:45.650 --> 00:21:50.330
Whenever Yano kisses me, I can't think of anything else.

00:21:54.040 --> 00:22:00.000
I'm so scared of that version of me, but I just can't think of a world without Yano anymore.

00:22:08.930 --> 00:22:11.640
But it makes me remember all those times, all the way down to the tips of my hair...

00:22:16.940 --> 00:22:20.810
If Yano disappeared, I wonder what I'd do...

00:22:29.450 --> 00:22:32.490
If the person I loved disappeared...

00:22:35.750 --> 00:22:40.000
If the person I loved stopped looking at me...

00:23:15.620 --> 00:23:17.040
Please...

00:23:22.170 --> 00:23:25.710
Always, always stand by my side, Yano.
